  Cases_on `compile_word_copy_loop_base (Var src) (Lit (n2w off)) cnt LocMemory LocCode T imm sm` >>
  rename1 `compile_word_copy_loop_base _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ = (u,sn)` >>
